  "idea": "LocalSend: share files between iPhone, Android, and PC with zero cables",
  "text": "Stop emailing files to yourself just to get them from your phone to your PC. Snapping product photos on mobile only to wait on email attachment limits stalls creative momentum. Email clients cap file attachments at twenty-five megabytes and strip high-resolution camera metadata. LocalSend eliminates manual emailing by establishing instant peer-to-peer file sharing across your local network. Your photos land on desktop instantly at full original quality.",
